      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marble%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Yule Marble from Marble was used to build New York City's Equitable Building, an early skyscraper.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marble%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Eight sites in Marble are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marble%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A railroad reached Marble in 1906, boosting its growth, but tracks were removed in 1942.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
