      ],
      "source": "https://westernmininghistory.com/towns/colorado/marble/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Marble's quarry stone is nearly pure calcite, praised as one of the world’s cleanest marbles rivaling Italian and Greek varieties.",
